{"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Test 3","h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.83950617285436313,"y":0.034746760673292743,"w":0.061728394826253252},{"c":1,"y":0.084302325466841022,"t":"ADAM:","w":0.04732510248819987,"h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.059670781991029119},{"y":0.12921911443164236,"h":0.011910608154584557,"x":0.06166241731255423,"t":"ROSIE:","c":1,"w":0.049514671961466472},{"w":0.047719961802164708,"c":1,"h":0.011132177391097176,"t":"ADAM:","x":0.059473352364489716,"y":0.1448699577875201},{"c":1,"y":0.15984606068511775,"x":0.061712898677301099,"w":0.049413709640502922,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.010249738839265166},{"x":0.061649103550623759,"t":"ADAM:","y":0.23816201633521616,"w":0.045426073074340816,"h":0.0091410834601124424,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.061523346371530938,"w":0.04996332804361979,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.0097783867124955348,"y":0.25352256917104377},{"w":0.045770943959554021,"c":1,"t":"ADAM:","h":0.011354414958976267,"x":0.061476668408786385,"y":0.26830535047800075},{"w":0.049382715225219719,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"t":"ROSIE:","y":0.34593023245995003,"x":0.06172839537092923,"c":1},{"h":0.0089096809584906511,"x":0.061692323797831489,"t":"ADAM:","y":0.36182422926794722,"c":1,"w":0.045339632034301761},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"ROSIE:","x":0.05967078295818061,"y":0.39098837184318225,"c":1,"w":0.051440327962239574},{"x":0.061728394939224801,"t":"ADAM:","y":0.40843023245995003,"w":0.045267489751180029,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1},{"w":0.051440327962239588,"y":0.43749999979860854,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"ROSIE:","x":0.059670782743845907,"c":1},{"h":0.0094598527510680874,"y":0.46910728290763748,"c":1,"t":"ADAM:","x":0.061591383733345113,"w":0.045541512171427413},{"y":0.48401162768836581,"w":0.049382715225219719,"c":1,"x":0.061728395885332514,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.010174418787512463},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"t":"ADAM:","x":0.059670782665167912,"c":1,"y":0.51744186021527527,"w":0.049382715225219725},{"x":0.15843622362749255,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.081272084864524863,"c":1,"t":"Yeah, so if you look at the amount of calories in a pizza, they'll give you the","w":0.59876541137695316},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"y":0.097383720797119877,"t":"calories per quarter pizza and you think, oh that's not too bad. But who's going to","w":0.64403289794921881,"x":0.15843622582387173},{"w":0.16082796732584634,"x":0.1603513648009067,"c":1,"t":"eat a quarter pizza?","y":0.11327145378840486,"h":0.012878444366095532},{"c":1,"w":0.62139918009440098,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.14389534870386189,"x":0.15843621230513094,"t":"I suppose another approach to this problem is to get people to exercise more."},{"t":"Right. In England, the current guidelines are for at least 30 minutes of brisk","x":0.16044726500238332,"y":0.15829863874707228,"w":0.59681004842122398,"h":0.015050350004989221,"c":1},{"t":"walking, five days a week. Now when you ask them, about 40% of men and","x":0.15843621515791539,"y":0.17432273272829502,"c":1,"w":0.60288065592447915,"h":0.014723203769140047},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.19040697662448069,"c":1,"t":"30% of women say they do this, but when you objectively measure the amount","w":0.62962961832682296,"x":0.1584362195402923},{"x":0.15843621872887448,"y":0.20494186032859252,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.63580245971679683,"c":1,"t":"of walking they do with motion sensors, you find that only 6% of men and 4% of"},{"t":"women do the recommended amount of exercise.","w":0.39711934407552074,"x":0.15843621277162456,"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.2208480563712798,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.15843621466594252,"t":"Mm, so you can see why obesity is growing.","w":0.35596707661946614,"h":0.014553715960858638,"y":0.23691860451591862},{"c":1,"w":0.46502059936523438,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.16049381544083957,"y":0.25145348825161928,"t":"So how can people be encouraged to take more exercise?"},{"w":0.63580245971679683,"h":0.01472320376914027,"y":0.26737338056277182,"c":1,"t":"Well, for example, think of the location of stairs in a train station. If people reach","x":0.15843621859839174},{"t":"the stairs before they reach the escalator when they're leaving the station, they're","y":0.2834302324384621,"w":0.65020573933919268,"x":0.15637861170700035,"c":1,"h":0.013095091313158891},{"x":0.15843621332323968,"y":0.29796511614452614,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"w":0.61522633870442711,"t":"more likely to take the stairs. And if you increase the width of the stairs, you'll"},{"h":0.017633970550429257,"y":0.31113143336084392,"t":"get more people using them at the same time. It's an unconscious process and","x":0.15838020103743608,"w":0.62973968505859368,"c":1},{"w":0.43621398925781252,"t":"influenced by minor modifications in their environment.","h":0.013089955625320671,"x":0.1584362151109231,"y":0.32848837197107972,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.64814814249674479,"t":"Right. And it might not be a big change, but if it happens every day, it all adds up.","y":0.34302325562325198,"x":0.15843621805809097,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"x":0.15843620798756358,"w":0.59465021769205739,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"Yes. But actually, I'm not sure if we should be talking about exercise in our","y":0.35895170804356258},{"t":"presentation.","x":0.15830707430782795,"y":0.37451735128021379,"w":0.10938496907552084,"h":0.014471703339521746,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.15843621180982315,"w":0.37448560078938797,"t":"Well, we've done quite a bit of reading about it.","y":0.38953488356795785},{"w":0.62551442464192708,"x":0.15843620321926077,"y":0.40547703168171645,"t":"I know, but it's going to mean we have a very wide focus, and our tutor did say","h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1},{"y":0.42137809205327015,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"that we need to focus on causes and solutions in terms of nutrition.","x":0.16049383050661048,"w":0.53292180379231768,"c":1},{"x":0.15834164051230062,"y":0.43472454558410256,"h":0.016973572990498398,"t":"I suppose so. And we've got plenty of information about that. OK, well that will be","c":1,"w":0.6462664286295573},{"w":0.067901236216227207,"t":"simpler.","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.15843621302140776,"y":0.45203488356895183,"c":1},{"t":"So what shall we do now? We've still got half an hour before our next lecture.","w":0.61522633870442711,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.16049382662103748,"c":1,"y":0.46643109531490989},{"x":0.15833786544704179,"y":0.48025759707169546,"c":1,"t":"Let's think about what we're going to include and what will go where. Then we","w":0.62158991495768234,"h":0.018421659480837405},{"x":0.1584362160991564,"h":0.013100227562642619,"c":1,"w":0.26337448120117191,"y":0.49852767952554244,"t":"can decide what slides we need."},{"y":0.5157213942293869,"w":0.076332492828369125,"c":1,"h":0.015068838818193986,"x":0.1583358110357834,"t":"OK, fine."},{"x":0.82992762779770624,"y":0.17237361183516464,"w":0.039761603673299062,"h":0.015958470365885935,"c":1,"t":"Q27"},{"t":"Q28","y":0.26598837193186486,"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"x":0.83127572077501255,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.3590116277509483,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.8333333337210258,"t":"Q29","w":0.034979422887166489,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Q30","x":0.83333333393687814,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"y":0.48255813939809178},{"c":1,"x":0.061660741187106537,"h":0.016437536134034647,"y":0.56518239470745757,"t":"PART 4","w":0.10507357915242513},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Good morning everyone. So today we're going to look at an important creative activity and","w":0.71810699462890626,"x":0.061728395586781393,"c":1,"y":0.59447674405334894},{"c":1,"t":"that's hand knitting. Ancient knitted garments have been found in many different countries,","w":0.72016459147135414,"x":0.061728403746245324,"y":0.60895170804621257,"h":0.01472320376914027},{"h":0.014575971731448756,"t":"showing that knitting is a global activity with a long history.","x":0.061728383334319306,"w":0.46502059936523443,"y":0.62499999986573274,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.0616646275512601,"h":0.016916441271527027,"w":0.6647580973307291,"t":"When someone says the word 'knitting' we might well picture an elderly person - a","y":0.64590344276610878},{"c":1,"t":"grandmother perhaps - sitting by the fire knitting garments for themselves or other members","x":0.061728392809305033,"y":0.66279069753812558,"w":0.7366255187988282,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"c":1,"t":"of the family. It's a homely image, but one that may lead you to feel that knitting is an activity","x":0.061728384594906725,"w":0.73456792195638021,"y":0.6787396937813408,"h":0.014574259835502756},{"c":1,"t":"of the past - and, indeed, during the previous decade, it was one of the skills that was","w":0.68312759399414069,"y":0.69464075357775401,"x":0.063785997134085948,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"c":1,"w":0.70576131184895841,"x":0.061728397474381233,"t":"predicted to vanish from everyday life. For although humans have sewn and knitted their","y":0.70930232544854399,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"h":0.014560564106288587,"t":"own clothing for a very long time, many of these craft-based skills went into decline when","y":0.72526501741736094,"c":1,"x":0.061728388368492704,"w":0.70987655639648439},{"y":0.73966663590371184,"h":0.014471210214639596,"w":0.73052815755208333,"t":"industrial machines took over - mainly because they were no longer passed down from one","x":0.061696252877814099,"c":1},{"x":0.061728403749568388,"y":0.75581395335527646,"w":0.72016459147135425,"t":"generation to another. However, that's all changing and interest in knitting classes in many","h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1},{"t":"countries is actually rising, as more and more people are seeking formal instruction in the","c":1,"x":0.063724807580847156,"y":0.76987764031120109,"w":0.70998575846354162,"h":0.016402705117305461},{"y":0.78621908103351656,"x":0.061728391779095851,"w":0.74279836018880208,"c":1,"t":"skill. With that trend, we're also seeing an increase in the sales figures for knitting equipment.","h":0.016195524146054185},{"y":0.80948174314689247,"x":0.061728385539842112,"t":"So why do people want to be taught to knit at a time when a machine can readily do the job","w":0.72839508056640612,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"h":0.015996932421752708,"c":1,"t":"for them? The answer is that knitting, as a handicraft, has numerous benefits for those doing","y":0.82558139520286322,"x":0.059670787752832931,"w":0.73868311564127598},{"c":1,"w":0.71604939778645837,"y":0.84156976730910771,"t":"it. Let's consider what some of these might be. While many people knitted garments in the","x":0.063786000590551978,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"c":1,"h":0.019013405969482755,"t":"past because they couldn't afford to buy clothes, it's still true today that knitting can be helpful","x":0.063679671621161726,"y":0.85466821037896945,"w":0.74300028483072922},{"c":1,"x":0.063786001524347422,"t":"if you're experiencing economic hardship. If you have several children who all need warm","y":0.87209302312260328,"h":0.01453830777405285,"w":0.70987655639648439},{"x":0.83333333393687814,"t":"Q31","w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.64680232542296234},{"t":"Q32","y":0.69331395332993895,"c":1,"x":0.83333333393687814,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"y":0.78633720914629712,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q33","w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.83333333394292997,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.85610465100676214,"c":1,"x":0.83333333394292997,"t":"Q34"},{"y":0.90843023239970644,"x":0.86419753146774236,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"113","c":1},{"h":0.024809838464599832,"c":1,"x":0.71966690167381475,"w":0.25204678853352869,"y":0.95602228051396954,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"h":3396}